Z||000000||sk8rpunk48162||02-05-2001||06:33 AM||||I wondered i have an 86 se and does it come with a factory subwoofer, i located a speaker under the passanger console. i think thats it but no sound was coming out of it.. can i take those two wires to a road gear amp i have??? sorry sounds confusing., please reply||||reg||5
Z||000001||FieroJoe||02-05-2001||10:09 AM||||Do you have a slider switch on your map light assembly that says "Performance sound"?  If so, yes you have a factory sub under there.  There already is an amp wired to it, hidden under the carpet.  If you want to power it to an aftermarket amp, those two wires are the sound input for the speaker.<P>------------------<BR>FieroJoe<BR>c311t@yahoo.com<BR>AIM: Fiero87311, Snowboarder0311<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||286SE'S||02-05-2001||11:50 AM||||I tried to power that sub with another amp and it sounded awfull. It was because the original speaker has the foam surround rotted away. A new speaker from Rodney Dickman made it sound the way it should and I went with the factory amp. Don't expect a lot from a 5-1/4" speaker. More power will just distort the sound.||||reg||1
Z||000003||mbramble||02-05-2001||12:10 PM||||I just bought a factory sub-box for my non-sub equipped car.  Used a 5 1/4" sub from Radio Shack, one of their sub crossovers and a small amp I bought at a TV/audio store (discontinued line, only cost $13).  Wired it all in Sun and it sounds very nice.  Doesn't hit real hard but really rounds out the sound of the music.||||reg||1
Z||000004||FieroJoe||02-05-2001||09:16 PM||||While we are on this topic, does anybody know if the factory sub amp has a crossover built into it?  I looked at the wiring diagram, and it has all speaker level input to it, from all 4 channels.  I have a complete factory sub system that I bought from FieroMaster88 and have yet to install, just wondering if a crossover would be needed for clear bass.<P>TIA||||reg||5
Z||000005||LZeitgeist||02-06-2001||11:27 AM||||The amp takes the signal from all the speaker outputs from the stereo and filters out the highs - only bass signal is coming out of the factory amp.||||reg||1
